            "section_name": "The [[IN]] Map",
            "kicker": "GEOGRAPHY",
            "body": "A full Australian map, dotted with the location of every kid who's been published in the issue. Built-in geography lesson: how far apart are these creators? What landmarks sit between them? Whose dot is closest to your school? Brilliant for distance, scale, mapping conventions and place-based discussion. Bonus when one of the dots ends up belonging to your classroom.",
