          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "number": "06",
            "section_name": "What's Not to Like?",
            "kicker": "PROBLEM-SOLVING",
            "body": "Kid-created jokes, riddles, puzzles, codes and cool facts. Brilliant warm-up content, mental break activities, or a launching pad for your own classroom problem-solving sessions. Get your students designing their own riddles to send [[IN]] - the cognitive load is significant, and the engagement is immediate."
